  "coder_notes": "Single-arm Phase 1/2 of a PARP inhibitor (NMS-03305293, keyword 'PARP inhibitor') plus temozolomide. Temozolomide is the combination partner given to every patient, so soc_backbone and NMS-03305293 the only investigational agent. Phase 1 enrols diffuse gliomas including glioblastoma; backfill and Phase 2 require IDH-wildtype GBM per WHO 2021. MGMT: central testing is required but restriction by MGMT status is only a sponsor option ('Sponsor may opt to restrict enrollment based on MGMT status'), so coded as exploratory rather than eligibility. PK is plasma and urine only."
